OL,2,V55555555CREFORMISTS AHEAD IN
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CSOVIET ELECTIONS
OL,5, Candidates backing sweeping reform in
OL,6, the Soviet Union are far ahead of
OL,7, orthodox Communists as returns trickle
OL,8, in from elections in three republics.
OL,10, Maverick politician Boris Yeltsin took
OL,11, 72% of the vote in the Urals city of
OL,12, Sverdlovsk to win a seat in the Russian
OL,13, parliament.
OL,15, President Gorbachev says the elections
OL,16, there and in Byelorussia and the
OL,17, Ukraine are vital for perestroika.
OL,19, Elsewhere, TV presenters, journalists,
OL,20, actors and economists were elected but
OL,21, there will be run-offs for many seats.
OL,23,F]DFrom 05-03-90 / teletextarchive.com
