OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F181A1772723399
OL,5, Israel is defying her closest ally, the
OL,6, United States, and calling for the
OL,7, settling of as many Soviet Jewish
OL,8, immigrants as possible in Jerusalem.
OL,10, Prime Minister Yitzhak Shamir's remarks
OL,11, follow President Bush's demand for a
OL,12, halt to their settlement in the Arab,
OL,13, eastern part seized by Israel in 1967.
OL,15, Jerusalem is at the centre of the
OL,16, Israeli-Palestinian conflict, with each
OL,17, side claiming it for its capital.
OL,19, Israel is wrangling over US proposals
OL,20, to let West Bank Palestinians who live
OL,21, in E Jerusalem join Cairo peace talks.
OL,23,F]DFrom 05-03-90 / teletextarchive.com
