OL,2,V55555555CPATTEN ACTS TO
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CCLEAN UP NORTH SEA
OL,5, Britain is to ban the discharge of raw
OL,6, sewage from coastal towns by the end of
OL,7, 1998, Environment Secretary Chris
OL,8, Patten has announced.
OL,10, And the incineration of waste at sea
OL,11, will be banned by the end of this year.
OL,13, He told a London press conference that
OL,14, the action demonstrated Britain's
OL,15, commitment to "improving the quality of
OL,16, the North Sea and our coastal waters."
OL,18, Mr Patten announced the measures on the
OL,19, eve of the third North Sea ministers'
OL,20, conference in The Hague.
OL,23,F]DFrom 05-03-90 / teletextarchive.com
