OL,2,V55555555CNUM TO DISCUSS
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CSTRIKE FUNDS ROW
OL,5, The NUM executive has called a special
OL,6, meeting on claims that miners' leaders
OL,7, Arthur Scargill and Peter Heathfield
OL,8, used Libyan money to pay personal debts
OL,10, But in a statement the NUM dismissed as
OL,11, "nothing but vicious lies" reports that
OL,12, the union received any funds from Libya
OL,13, and the USSR during the 1984 strike.
OL,15, And it added that no union money or
OL,16, money donated for hardship purposes had
OL,17, been used for the "personal needs" of
OL,18, Mr Scargill and Mr Heathfield.
OL,20, The NUM had "perfectly properly" spent
OL,21, money on the two men's houses which
OL,22, were owned by the union.
OL,23,F]DFrom 05-03-90 / teletextarchive.com
